WEBVTT

00:04:59.663 --> 00:05:03.038
Iceland, Norway and Finland
ranked top three

00:05:03.038 --> 00:05:04.579
in the Global Gender Gap Index,

00:05:04.579 --> 00:05:07.246
and over 70 percent of fathers
take paternity leave.

00:05:07.996 --> 00:05:11.413
And if you take a look at their ranking
in the World Happiness Report,

00:05:11.413 --> 00:05:13.663
they’re very, very high.

00:05:13.996 --> 00:05:16.079
This might be a coincidence, but ...

00:05:16.079 --> 00:05:17.121
I don’t think so.

00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:18.704
That freedom to be yourself

00:05:18.704 --> 00:05:21.371
and make choices
without gender expectations,

00:05:21.371 --> 00:05:22.746
it feels really good.

00:05:22.996 --> 00:05:24.371
We live in a patriarchy.

00:05:24.788 --> 00:05:29.579
And what I've realized is that the same
world that systematically favors men,

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:31.413
it's also trapping us in a cage.